  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM Turkey 2010-2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IOM Turkey 2010-2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet st&#xf6;djer genomf&#xf6;randet av &quot;2004 national action plan on      Migration and Asylum&quot; vilken &#xe4;r ett kraven f&#xf6;r EU n&#xe4;rmande, och       omfattar omr&#xe5;den som fri r&#xf6;rlighet, s&#xe4;kerhets-, arbetsmarknads- och   MR fr&#xe5;gor. Vidare har projektet en komponent som handlar om st&#xf6;d till genomf&#xf6;rande av &quot;2nd National Action Plan on Combating Trafficking in Turkey&quot;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the implementation of the 2004 National Action   Plan on Migration and Asylum, which is a requirement for EU accession and includes free movement, security, labour mobility and human       rights issues. The project also has a component providing support to  implementation of the 2nd National Action Plan on Combating           Trafficking in Turkey.</narrative>
  </description>
